@startuml
title H03 - Hub time
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #2877B5
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #17324D
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F7FA
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1BF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9C6500
left to right direction
component "H03\nHub time" as H03
interface "TrustedClock::anchor(); estimate(); valid_for_absence()" as API
database "Owned state\ntrusted server anchor, monotonic anchor and uncertainty" as State
queue "Input / output\nAuthenticated time anchor + monotonic now → earliest/latest wall-time estimate and trust" as IO
API --> H03
IO --> H03
H03 --> State : owns
component "S01\nShared contracts" as S01
H03 ..> S01 : contract / port
component "H05\nHub rules adapter" as H05
H03 ..> H05 : contract / port
component "H07\nHub lifecycle/config" as H07
H03 ..> H07 : contract / port
note bottom of H03
Flow: Advance from monotonic elapsed time; expand uncertainty by conservative drift; expire anchor after 72 hours; gate absence evaluation by trust and uncertainty.
Guard: No anchor, monotonic rollback or expired anchor produces untrusted/expired state. Manual buttons remain valid elsewhere.
Status: Host complete; target pending
end note
@enduml
